# CODEOWNERS — puts a human in the loop on every PR.
#
# When branch protection requires review from Code Owners, the owners below are
# automatically requested on any PR that touches these paths, and the PR cannot
# be merged until one of them approves. This is the enforced downstream
# counterpart to the PRD approval gate (DoR gate 8) upstream.
#
# Replace the placeholder handles with real GitHub users/teams before relying on
# this. An unmatched path falls through to the catch-all owner.

# Catch-all — every change needs a human approver.
*                       @OWNER

# Control-plane changes carry the most risk — require the framework owners.
/decision-engine/       @OWNER
/pipeline/              @OWNER
/promise/               @OWNER
/attestation/           @OWNER
/.ai-sdlc/              @OWNER

# Product artifacts — a human product owner signs off on PRDs.
/docs/prd/              @OWNER
